  "question": {
    "text": "Let $A=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc}1 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right)(10) B=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc}4 & 2 & 2 \\\\ -5 & 0 & \\alpha \\\\ 1 & -2 & 3\\end{array}\\right)$. If $B$"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "\n$-2$\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n5\n",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "\n2\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n$-1$",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "$A B=I \\Rightarrow A(10 B)=10 \\mathrm{I}$\n$\\Rightarrow\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc}1 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right]\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc}4 & 2 & 2 \\\\ -5 & 0 & \\alpha \\\\ 1 & -2 & 3\\end{array}\\right]=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc}10 & 0 & 5-\\alpha \\\\ 0 & 10 & \\alpha-5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 5+\\alpha\\end{array}\\right]=10\\left[\\begin{array}{lll}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{array}\\right]$ if $\\alpha=5$."
  }
}